e to sterile 30 ppt filtered seawater (950mls filtered\nL19@P0: seawater: 30mls deionised water)\nL20@P0: 5. For 1/2 strength Modified Provasoli add 10 ml sterile stock per litre of sterile 30 ppt\nL21@P0: filtered seawater (950mls filtered seawater: 40mls deionised water)\nL22@P0: 6. For agar add 15g per litre Bacteriological Agar.\nL23@P0: * half strength; 4-12 °C; white fluorescent light 200 Lux, 12h or less.\nL24@P0: Iron-EDTA\nL25@P0: Fe(NH4)2(SO4)2 x 6 H2O 0.70 g\nL26@P0: Na2-EDTA 0.60 g\nL27@P0: PII trace metals\nL28@P0: Na2-EDTA 1.000 g\nL29@P0: H3BO3 1.120 g\nL30@P0: MnSO4 x 4 H2O 0.120 g\nL31@P0: ZnSO4 x 7 H2O 0.022 g\nL32@P0: CoSO4 x 7 H2O 0.005 g\nL33@P0: © 2022 CCAP - All rights reserved Page 1 of 1\n"
